OL,3,ACrimea bridge shut after Ukrainian
OL,4,Astrike, as Russia hits Kyiv crossings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key bridge linking occupied Crimea
OL,7,Fand Russia is closed after a Ukrainian
OL,8,Fstrike inflicted major damage on the
OL,9,Fprized Kremlin asset.
OL,11,FImages shared by Ukrainian officials
OL,12,Fshowed a section of the Crimean Bridge
OL,13,F- also known as the Kerch Bridge - had
OL,14,Fcollapsed into the water.
OL,16,FRussian officials confirmed the
OL,17,Fstructure had been damaged by drones,
OL,18,Fwhile Russia's deputy prime minister
OL,19,Fwas due to chair an emergency meeting
OL,20,Fto discuss the situation.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
