OL,3,ACrimea bridge shut after Ukrainian
OL,4,Astrike, as Russia hits Kyiv crossings
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Kyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,7,Fsaid the Northern and Southern bridges,
OL,8,Fboth important crossings over the
OL,9,FDnipro River, were closed after Russia
OL,10,Ftargeted the Ukrainian capital
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
